{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#card-zh","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-exa-search 为 DSH Web 客户端接入 Exa 网页搜索与页面抓取，并在设置页管理接入方式和工具。它注册 Exa 搜索、筛选搜索、批量抓取、相似页面查找、问答、研究、监控、数据集、批处理和状态查询工具，也将 DSH 原有 web_search 与 web_fetch 路由到 Exa。可选择免登录 MCP、Exa API Key 或 Exa 账号 OAuth；API Key 模式提供更多 REST 功能。适合需要在 DSH 会话中检索网页、读取多个页面或开展多步研究的用户。使用 API Key 或账号模式时，搜索请求会发送至 Exa；免登录模式无需额外凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-91","index.js:1864-1882","index.js:2842-2880","cordis.patch.yml:12-26"]}
{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#card-en","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-exa-search adds Exa web search and page fetching to DSH. It routes native web_search and web_fetch through Exa and provides filtered search, batch page reading, and research tools. A settings panel switches between keyless MCP, API key, and Exa account access. API key mode enables more features.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:81-91","index.js:1864-1882","index.js:2842-2880","cordis.patch.yml:12-26"]}
