{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#feature-1","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-exa-search** 的功能「筛选搜索」：通过 Exa 搜索网页，可按域名、类别、日期、文本条件及子页筛选，并返回排序来源和摘录。调用 exa_search，输入自然语言查询与筛选参数。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1904-1955"]}
{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#feature-2","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-exa-search** 的功能「批量抓取」：读取一个或多个已知网址，最多五页并发处理三页；可设置每页字符上限，API Key 模式还支持摘要、高亮和子页抓取。调用 exa_fetch 并传入网址列表。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2028-2075"]}
{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#feature-3","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-exa-search** 的功能「研究任务」：通过 Exa Agent 开展多步研究并返回结果；任务超时后可用 runId 继续等待，API Key 模式还可取消。调用 exa_research 并提交查询。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2166-2225"]}
{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#feature-4","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"**dsh-exa-search** 的功能「网页抓取路由」：让 DSH 原生 web_fetch 请求由 Exa 提供内容，返回页面正文及截断状态。由 DSH Web 服务调用，不需额外命令。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:2865-2880","cordis.patch.yml:12-16"]}
{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#caveat-1","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-exa-search 使用 API Key 或 Exa OAuth 时，会向 Exa API 或 MCP 发送搜索词、目标网址及相应请求参数；免登录模式也会把查询发送至 Exa MCP。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:45-47","index.js:1045-1078"]}
{"unit_id":"kiranasuka__dsh-exa-search#caveat-2","repo":"kiranasuka/dsh-exa-search","commit":"42cec7f7d0cc96379747c18df3be478a1b499942","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-exa-search 可从 EXA_API_KEY 环境变量读取 API Key；也支持在设置页保存凭据，并使用 Harness 凭据服务或本机状态文件保存接入信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:25-26","index.js:729-750"]}
